<title>TUNISIA: Tunisie Leasing distributes dividends.</title>
<headline>Tunisie Leasing distributes dividends.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisie Leasing  on Wednesday said it has started distributing a 1.15 dinar corresponding to 11.5 percent dividend per share on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>The lease firm post-tax net profits amounted to 2.662 million dinars in 1996, up from 2.236 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>Its total balance sheet in 1996 was 116.696 million dinars, up from 93.428 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>Tunisie Leasing capital and reserves were 17.942 million dinars at end of 1996. ($=1.0957 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom 2161-787538</p>
